//@version=6
//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// SCHOOLS 10 — XAUUSD M1
//
// Ten entry rules and nothing else. No router, no arbiter, no vote, no source
// priority. Each school has its own settings, its own target and stop, its own
// cooldown, and its own switch for whether it waits for the position to be free.
//
// It exists because of one measurement. The old engine handed every school a
// 35.6-point target against a 53.8-point stop, and that plan breaks even at
// 60.2%. Wired through it, Keltner made -183 points at a 60.1% win rate. The same
// signal on the same bars, given a target at twice its stop, made +10,733 at
// 41.8%. Nothing about the rule changed — only the plan it was handed.
//
// So every plan here is a multiple of the average bar range rather than a number
// of points, and every target is larger than its stop. There is no distance in
// points anywhere in this file. That matters: the average one-minute bar is 21.4
// points in 2026, 3.9 in 2021 and 3.6 in 2023, so a plan written in raw points is
// a plan written for one year only.
//
// The win rates near 35% are the price of a 2:1 target and are not a fault — such
// a plan cannot win more often than it loses. It does mean long losing runs.
// Measured on 2026, all ten sharing one position: worst run 20, drawdown 5,062.
// Flattening to a 1:1 target raises the win rate to 51% and makes the drawdown
// WORSE, 5,330, while halving the profit. A comfortable win rate is bought with
// money, not with safety.
//
// Standalone on 2026, one position each, sorted by edge — points per trade above
// entering at random on the same side with the same plan, so a falling year
// cannot flatter a sell rule:
//
//   school                    side   plan    /day    WR      net    edge
//   ① measured reversion      BUY    6x/3x    4.5   36.0   +5,283   9.33
//   ② EMA ribbon pullback     SELL   6x/3x    8.5   35.6   +8,401   5.08
//   ③ CMO snap                BUY    4x/2x   11.7   35.2   +7,259   4.83
//   ④ QUAD RSI3+RSI14         BUY    4x/2x   19.5   35.0  +11,938   4.79
//   ⑤ RMI overbought fade     SELL   6x/3x   12.2   36.3  +10,043   3.85
//   ⑥ TSI fade                BUY    4x/2x   18.3   34.9   +8,797   3.84
//   ⑦ Keltner touch           BUY    4x/2x   18.1   35.1   +8,483   3.76
//   ⑧ Keltner band pierce     SELL   6x/3x   18.7   35.7  +14,118   3.38
//   ⑨ QUAD RSI3+RSI14         SELL   4x/2x   15.2   36.0   +9,848   3.20
//   ⑩ Keltner touch           SELL   4x/2x   13.9   35.5   +8,930   3.17
//
// ① is not a standard band. Bollinger takes its width from the deviation of
// closes and Keltner from a multiple of bar range; neither asks how far price
// actually gets before it turns. This records every swing high as its distance
// above the centre in bar-ranges and sets the upper line at a percentile of the
// last sixty of them, and does the same below from the swing lows. A swing is
// only counted once its right shoulder has printed, so nothing uses information
// the chart did not have at the time. Keeping the two sides apart makes the band
// asymmetric whenever rallies and dips are punished differently — which no
// symmetric band can be. It has the highest edge of the ten by a wide margin.
//
// WHAT WAS TRIED THIS ROUND AND SHIPS OFF
//
// Nine of the ten fade rules fire within five bars of each other on the same
// side, and twelve of thirteen lose money once the market picks a direction — the
// EMA ribbon makes +7.14 a trade in the quiet and -63.69 in a trend. So two
// repairs were built: a regime gate per school, and six rules that need the
// market to move. Standalone both measured strongly; breaking the 240-bar high in
// a trend has an edge of 15.45 against the best fade rule's 9.33.
//
// Both lose money in the configuration that actually ships. On 2026, one shared
// position:
//
//   fade only, no gates           43.0/day  35.79%  +32,469  drawdown  4,892
//   fade + trend on its own slot  50.4/day  37.05%  +33,242  drawdown  8,724
//   fade + gates 0.35             36.3/day  35.73%  +23,051  drawdown  5,516
//   fade + gates + trend shared   38.1/day  36.40%  +17,611  drawdown  7,641
//
// A standalone edge is measured with a position always available. Here there is
// one, and a rule holding it for an 8x target blocks every fade trade that would
// have used those hours. The edge is real; the rent on the slot is higher.
//
// So the gates ship at 1.00, which is no gate, and schools 11 to 16 ship off.
// Both are one click away if the market changes shape.
//
//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
indicator("SCHOOLS 16 + HULL GATE — XAUUSD M1", "SCHOOLS16", overlay=true, max_labels_count=500, max_lines_count=500, max_bars_back=1000)

color BUY_C  = color.rgb(0, 170, 90)
color SELL_C = color.rgb(230, 45, 55)
color TP_C   = color.rgb(0, 120, 255)
color SL_C   = color.rgb(230, 45, 55)
color EN_C   = color.rgb(255, 210, 0)
color TXT_C  = color.white
color TBL_BG      = color.rgb(16, 18, 26)
color TBL_BG_HEAD = color.rgb(22, 24, 34)
color TBL_BG_ROW  = color.rgb(18, 20, 30)
color TBL_BG_ROW2 = color.rgb(20, 22, 32)

// ── 01 ■ General ──
G_MAIN = "01 ■ عام"
pointUnitInput = input.float(0.10, "1 Point = Price Move", minval=0.00001, step=0.01, group=G_MAIN)
pointUnit = pointUnitInput <= 0 ? 0.10 : pointUnitInput
allowLong = input.bool(true, "اسمح بالشراء", group=G_MAIN)
allowShort = input.bool(true, "اسمح بالبيع", group=G_MAIN)
maxHold = input.int(600, "أقصى شموع للصفقة قبل الإغلاق", minval=10, maxval=5000, group=G_MAIN)

// ── 02 ■ Market Scale ──
// The unit every distance in this file is quoted in: how far a bar actually
// travels lately. Not ATR — no true range and no Wilder smoothing.
G_SCALE = "02 ■ مقياس السوق"
schLen = input.int(500, "شموع قياس مدى الشمعة", minval=50, maxval=5000, group=G_SCALE)
schRng = ta.sma(high - low, schLen) / pointUnit
schOK = schRng > 0

// ── 03 ■ Regime ──
// How straight the last N bars are: net travel over total travel. 1 is a ruler,
// 0 is churn. Every fade rule in this file loses money above roughly 0.35 and
// earns below it — the EMA ribbon makes +7.14 a trade in the quiet and -63.69 in
// a trend — so each school below carries the band of regime it is allowed to
// fire in rather than firing blind.
G_REG = "03 ■ حالة السوق"
regLen = input.int(60, "شموع قياس استقامة الحركة", minval=10, maxval=500, group=G_REG)
// hoisted: math.sum keeps a rolling state, so calling it twice in one
// expression is two claims on the same window
regPath = math.sum(math.abs(close - close[1]), regLen)
regNet = math.abs(close - close[regLen])
regEff = regPath <= 0 ? 0.0 : regNet / regPath
plot(regEff, "efficiency", display=display.none)

// ── 03b ■ Common pause ──
// His observation, made testable: in a trend the fade rules do not drift to zero,
// they lose hard and consistently — the EMA ribbon at -63.69 a trade, the
// reversion band -31.12, the EMA cloud -26.36. A rule that reliably loses is a
// rule that reliably wins reversed. And unlike a gate, a flip costs nothing in
// slot time: the same signal at the same moment for the same duration, with only
// the side changed — which is why it is worth testing after the gate failed.
// He sets the targets, in points. The multiples stay available because a number
// of points is a number about one volatility regime — 130 points was six bar
// ranges in 2026 and thirty-three in 2021, which is what broke the RMI source —
// but inside a period where the scale holds, a typed number is a typed number.
// The point defaults below are each school's swept multiple times 21.4, the
// average one-minute bar range on 2026, so switching modes changes nothing until
// he changes a number.
G_PLAN = "03d ■ الأهداف"
planPts = input.bool(true, "الأهداف بالنقاط (مطفي = ×مدى الشمعة)", group=G_PLAN)

G_FLIP = "03c ■ اقلب الاتجاه بالترند"
flipEff = input.float(1.00, "اقلب اتجاه مدارس العكس إذا الاستقامة فوق", minval=0.05, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group=G_FLIP, tooltip="1.00 = لا يقلب أبداً. أقل من هيك: لما السوق يمشي، السيل يصير باي والباي يصير سيل.")
flipOn = regEff >= flipEff

G_PAUSE = "03 ■ وقفة بعد الخسائر"
schPauseAfter = input.int(0, "وقف الكل بعد كم خسارة متتالية (0 = بدون)", minval=0, maxval=20, group=G_PAUSE, tooltip="4 خسائر ثم وقفة 60 شمعة نزّلت أكبر تراجع من 4,480 إلى 3,017 وأطول سلسلة من 20 إلى 16.")
schPauseBars = input.int(60, "طول الوقفة (شموع)", minval=0, maxval=600, group=G_PAUSE)

// ── 04 ■ Alerts / Webhook / Bot ──
G_ALERT = "04 ■ Alerts / Webhook / Bot"
sy963UseAlertFunction = input.bool(true, "Send BOT Message alert()", group=G_ALERT)
sy963WebhookKey = input.string("SECRET_135", "BOT Secret Key", group=G_ALERT)
sy963BotSymbol = input.string("XAUUSD", "BOT Symbol - Message Only", group=G_ALERT)
sy963LotSize = input.float(0.02, "BOT Lot Size - Message Only", minval=0.01, step=0.01, group=G_ALERT)
sy963AlertFormat = input.string("JSON", "alert() Message Format", options=["JSON", "Simple"], group=G_ALERT)

// ── 05 ■ Visuals ──
G_VIS = "05 ■ الإحصائيات والرسم"
showSignals = input.bool(true, "اعرض BUY / SELL", group=G_VIS)
showTradeLines = input.bool(true, "اعرض خطوط الصفقات المفتوحة فقط", group=G_VIS)
showResultLabels = input.bool(false, "اعرض لصائق TP / SL عند الخروج", group=G_VIS, tooltip="مطفي: الشارت يبقى نظيف. عشر مدارس تسكّر مئة صفقة باليوم، ومئة لصيقة بتدفن الشموع.")
showTable = input.bool(true, "اعرض الجدول", group=G_VIS)
lineBars = input.int(70, "طول الخطوط (شموع)", minval=5, maxval=500, group=G_VIS)
statsMode = input.string("All Loaded History", "بداية العد", options=["All Loaded History", "From Custom Time"], group=G_VIS)
statsStart = input.time(0, "من وقت", group=G_VIS)
statsCounted = statsMode == "All Loaded History" or time >= statsStart

//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// 10 ■ THE SCHOOLS
// Each block below is one school and holds everything about it: whether it runs,
// whether it waits for a free position, its target and stop as multiples of the
// bar range, its own cooldown, and its own parameters.
//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

// ① measured reversion band — BUY
G_S1 = "① قناة الارتداد المقيس — شراء"
s1On = input.bool(true, "شغّل", group=G_S1)
s1Resp = input.bool(true, "يحترم الصفقة المفتوحة", group=G_S1)
s1Tgt = input.float(6.0, "الهدف = كم مرة مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S1)
s1Stp = input.float(3.0, "الستوب = كم مرة مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S1)
s1TgtP = input.float(128, "   ...أو الهدف بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S1)
s1StpP = input.float(64, "   ...والستوب بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S1)
s1Cd = input.int(0, "كولداون بعد صفقتها (شموع)", minval=0, maxval=500, group=G_S1)
s1Centre = input.int(200, "طول خط المنتصف", minval=20, maxval=1000, group=G_S1)
s1Swing = input.int(8, "نصف عرض القمة/القاع (شموع)", minval=2, maxval=50, group=G_S1)
s1Mem = input.int(60, "كم قمة/قاع يتذكر", minval=20, maxval=300, group=G_S1)
s1Pct = input.int(85, "النسبة المئوية للخط", minval=50, maxval=99, group=G_S1)
s1Eff = input.float(1.00, "لا تشتغل إذا استقامة الحركة فوق", minval=0.05, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group=G_S1, tooltip="مدارس العكس تخسر بالترند. 0.35 قياس، و1.0 يعني بدون بوابة.")
s1Show = input.bool(true, "ارسم الخطين", group=G_S1)

// ② EMA ribbon pullback — SELL
G_S2 = "② شريط EMA — بيع"
s2On = input.bool(true, "شغّل", group=G_S2)
s2Resp = input.bool(true, "يحترم الصفقة المفتوحة", group=G_S2)
s2Tgt = input.float(6.0, "الهدف ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S2)
s2Stp = input.float(3.0, "الستوب ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S2)
s2TgtP = input.float(128, "   ...أو الهدف بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S2)
s2StpP = input.float(64, "   ...والستوب بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S2)
s2Cd = input.int(0, "كولداون (شموع)", minval=0, maxval=500, group=G_S2)
s2Fast = input.int(20, "EMA سريع", minval=3, maxval=100, group=G_S2)
s2MidL = input.int(50, "EMA وسط — خط الارتداد", minval=10, maxval=200, group=G_S2)
s2Slow = input.int(100, "EMA بطيء", minval=20, maxval=400, group=G_S2)
s2Eff = input.float(1.00, "لا تشتغل إذا استقامة الحركة فوق", minval=0.05, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group=G_S2, tooltip="بالقياس: +812 نقطة عند 0.25.")
s2Show = input.bool(false, "ارسم الشريط", group=G_S2)

// ③ CMO snap — BUY
G_S3 = "③ CMO — شراء"
s3On = input.bool(true, "شغّل", group=G_S3)
s3Resp = input.bool(true, "يحترم الصفقة المفتوحة", group=G_S3)
s3Tgt = input.float(4.0, "الهدف ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S3)
s3Stp = input.float(2.0, "الستوب ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S3)
s3TgtP = input.float(86, "   ...أو الهدف بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S3)
s3StpP = input.float(43, "   ...والستوب بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S3)
s3Cd = input.int(0, "كولداون (شموع)", minval=0, maxval=500, group=G_S3)
s3Len = input.int(9, "طول CMO", minval=3, maxval=50, group=G_S3)
s3Lvl = input.float(60.0, "مستوى CMO المتطرف", minval=20, maxval=95, step=1, group=G_S3)
s3Rsi = input.float(18.0, "RSI3 تحت", minval=5, maxval=45, step=1, group=G_S3)
s3Big = input.float(1.5, "الشمعة أكبر من ×ATR", minval=0.5, maxval=4, step=0.1, group=G_S3)
s3Eff = input.float(1.00, "لا تشتغل إذا استقامة الحركة فوق", minval=0.05, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group=G_S3)

// ④ QUAD — BUY
G_S4 = "④ QUAD — شراء"
s4On = input.bool(true, "شغّل", group=G_S4)
s4Resp = input.bool(true, "يحترم الصفقة المفتوحة", group=G_S4)
s4Tgt = input.float(4.0, "الهدف ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S4)
s4Stp = input.float(2.0, "الستوب ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S4)
s4TgtP = input.float(86, "   ...أو الهدف بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S4)
s4StpP = input.float(43, "   ...والستوب بالنقاط", minval=1, maxval=2000, step=1, group=G_S4)
s4Cd = input.int(0, "كولداون (شموع)", minval=0, maxval=500, group=G_S4)
s4R3 = input.float(18.0, "RSI3 تحت", minval=5, maxval=45, step=1, group=G_S4)
s4R14 = input.float(40.0, "RSI14 تحت", minval=15, maxval=50, step=1, group=G_S4)
s4Big = input.float(1.5, "الشمعة أكبر من ×ATR", minval=0.5, maxval=4, step=0.1, group=G_S4)
s4Eff = input.float(1.00, "لا تشتغل إذا استقامة الحركة فوق", minval=0.05, maxval=1.0, step=0.05, group=G_S4, tooltip="بالقياس: +1,590 نقطة عند 0.25.")

// ⑤ RMI overbought fade — SELL
G_S5 = "⑤ رمي — بيع"
s5On = input.bool(true, "شغّل", group=G_S5)
s5Resp = input.bool(true, "يحترم الصفقة المفتوحة", group=G_S5)
s5Tgt = input.float(6.0, "الهدف ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S5)
s5Stp = input.float(3.0, "الستوب ×مدى الشمعة", minval=0.5, maxval=20, step=0.1, group=G_S5)
