// 20 ■ WITH THE MOVE
//
// The ten above are one idea in ten costumes: nine of them fire within five bars
// of each other on the same side, and twelve of the thirteen measured lose money
// the moment the market picks a direction. So the set earns while price is still
// and hands it back as soon as it moves — which is exactly the shape of the
// drawdown, and exactly what he saw on the chart when it kept selling a rally.
//
// These six want the opposite. They need the market to be going somewhere, they
// fire when the fade rules are gated off, and their edge is larger than anything
// on the fade side. Measured on 2026 the same way — points per trade above a
// random entry on the same side with the same plan:
//
//   school                          side   plan   /day    WR     net    edge
//   ⑪ break the 240-bar high        BUY    8x/4x   1.4  39.6  +2,781  15.45
//   ⑫ break the 240-bar low         SELL   4x/3x   1.5  45.5  +3,248  14.39
//   ⑬ break the 60-bar high         BUY    8x/4x   1.6  38.1  +2,995  14.21
//   ⑭ break the 60-bar low          SELL   4x/3x   1.7  44.9  +2,223   8.22
//   ⑮ five down closes under EMA200 SELL   8x/4x  10.1  35.6 +11,466   5.39
//   ⑯ expansion bar with the trend  BUY    8x/4x   3.2  34.5  +2,496   6.55
//
// The best fade rule in this file has an edge of 9.33. Two of these are above 14.
//━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

